{"posts":[{"id":"3drive_p4_76","t":"Already have a position running from Thursday. THAT would have been a lovely place to have added to it. Being away from a computer at times sucketh.","a":"Rufus","d":"","n":"#76","p":4,"im":[],"m":76},{"id":"3drive_p4_77","t":"Hi all,:)\n\nHere is my first chart - many more to come in the next few days. Please, comments are welcome to know if i'm in the right direction.\n\nThanks! Adam","a":"AdamH","d":"","n":"#77","p":4,"im":["56a929e27fa4e7409d6e0ebf6cd5c2a441b7589a"],"m":77},{"id":"3drive_p4_78","t":"I like it:)","a":"kruger","d":"","n":"#78","p":4,"im":[],"m":78},{"id":"3drive_p4_79","t":"Hi,\n\n2 more. This Structure is hard to find...\n\nThanks,\n\nDBP/NZD, Daily:\n\nEUR/NZD, Daily:","a":"AdamH","d":"","n":"#79","p":4,"im":["3eed0d672a77addd86212f09f3b226f9885d169d","5de522d7f927f47634ee6fbdc9bc42de9e850a89"],"m":79},{"id":"3drive_p4_80","t":"First one found and traded on a chart i was working on.","a":"Stocky","d":"","n":"#80","p":4,"im":["22220e78eed8059fa5525b8f3b9bdd2871c759e8"],"m":80},{"id":"3drive_p4_81","t":"Hey everybody, Herein is my 1st attempt on 3drive. TNX","a":"Black Mamba","d":"","n":"#81","p":4,"im":["d8d10d5670b0944aa08e28d87f443f6e9f19e792"],"m":81},{"id":"3drive_p4_82","t":"Good going Mamba. There's also a big 3drive down on the same chart.","a":"AlexC","d":"","n":"#82","p":4,"im":["a88dc590d2093e941bfb271a2a196f265e0e404f"],"m":82},{"id":"3drive_p4_83","t":"the first one i think is valid as the price return to clear the bases it formed while moving up (thus CP). on the 2nd, all bases are intact. price didnt dip enough to clear them so no CP there. tell me if its not clear i'll draw it for you. the important thing to keep in mind on a 3drive is the clearing of any bases formed, so once it hits S/D price can move through the CPd bases easily. just my view.","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#83","p":4,"im":[],"m":83},{"id":"3drive_p4_84","t":"Harry wrote: on the 2nd, all bases are intact. price didnt dip enough to clear them so no CP there.\n\nHi, I guess you're referring to the EUR/NZD, right? Because the second reply had 2 charts in it (a total of 3 uploaded so far), and the GBP/NZD has CP in the 3drive stages.:)\n\ntnx","a":"AdamH","d":"","n":"#84","p":4,"im":[],"m":84},{"id":"3drive_p4_85","t":"exactly. if you compare EURAUD to your GBPNZD you will see on the GN the bases are consumed, on the AU not, even though eventually price does its thing after reaction to supply\n\nbases not consumed\n\nhere in GN see how the bases got consumed as it was moving higher.","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#85","p":4,"im":["d7bebfc17358bc2c830b68525e21324c51ca8cc9","d8c22f32bf073a2843e57bbb47d08196b8fcfea4"],"m":85},{"id":"3drive_p4_86","t":"hello my friend, your last example i think is not valid, as the 2nd swing up was lower than the previous. the CP at the bottom is good, only the top doesnt seem to be fit for a 3 drive. its a tricky pattern for sure and not so common but its worth a shot when you see it.","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#86","p":4,"im":[],"m":86},{"id":"3drive_p4_87","t":"looking good there Alex, for a moment i thought that the (2) was a base as it is was not visited by the next swing (3) but i had a look in m5 and its self-CPd","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#87","p":4,"im":["01a1310349e8892bcc3cdffa834c46ea94eb63df"],"m":87},{"id":"3drive_p4_88","t":"3 drive on gold into good support/demand area 1705.00. Tested a few times previously but due to extended move on the day price the 3 drive shows price got exhausted at the right place.","a":"jennyv","d":"","n":"#88","p":4,"im":["09d4cbf875c927b34bed2cd72d4b5d4e42e41b0c","28aa12a80923aadf690affb88c58ae2eb31b4dc1","7e24484f4f0b1457dca088de073cfa0a8f7659b6"],"m":88},{"id":"3drive_p4_89","t":"Hi Guys, Love to hear your feedback Thank you","a":"Pete44","d":"","n":"#89","p":4,"im":["328695ef0b94c64c67556d7eaffef83066b5e026","b134b22c868165d79d945c5433364149a3e0ec12","1150010ac0bc1f88c1402e246a59c18806de0271","053dd6dac238f348de3e773df3c6cfac63e27642","29d70be8816c85253561acd69aef1cbc198c819a","a0591e837d6bd26cfd7a1388b2b21090e770d19f","f2bb29ae94248cc5d4b29bd21149d7869b772153","e33db129f4a60ba3968dad60827c057eb7314808","d2b602e915db6297592507e463766e4f5af032c1"],"m":89},{"id":"3drive_p4_90","t":"Yup - it's easy to see the attempts to hide those positions. Nice work","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#90","p":4,"im":[],"m":90},{"id":"3drive_p4_91","t":"Good morning, I'm a new trader here. Just thought to post my first chart using S/D levels i see. I've been trading this stradegy for 3 weeks now. Still getting used to it But I'm a quick scalper on the 30M chart. Would a 4H chart work okay to find long term trend?","a":"thestarting","d":"","n":"#91","p":4,"im":[],"m":91},{"id":"3drive_p4_92","t":"Hello all,\n\nMy first 3Drive submission - GBPUSD.\n\nThanks in advance for any comments.\n\nSpongy.","a":"Spongiform","d":"","n":"#92","p":4,"im":["5a7393e9f8ada975b22c5a3cdf1b9169cbe42231","807affef362738a56bf4722d90e9bcdd6c1d1090","43095e52aa8f80b6c8344962214aa60587c0d031"],"m":92},{"id":"3drive_p4_93","t":"Ifmyante wrote: Yup - it's easy to see the attempts to hide those positions. Nice work\n\nThank you IF\n\nI will do homework on Find the decision & Read a Session. They are very interesting homeworks - just like Backtest. After that I'll trade again then I might have some thing to contribute.Hope to see everyone in classroom & trading room Cheers, Pete","a":"Pete44","d":"","n":"#93","p":4,"im":[],"m":93},{"id":"3drive_p4_94","t":"First 3 Drive homework attempt.\n\nThis first chart has some pretty obvious drives up, and compression, but the pattern doesn't fit into a neat channel like the example from IF at the start of this thread.\n\nCan it still be called a 3D? Or have I missed the point here entirely?\n\nAlso what is a BEFUL? It was also mentioned in IF's example.\n\nEUR/USD M5\n\nEUR/USD M5. A screenshot showing the demand, and also maybe FTR or 'Hook'??","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#94","p":4,"im":["b360f087d99d0bedcddc3fa82350b6b00157633a","b636b521683e019f560a20761c4741523be5c91c"],"m":94},{"id":"3drive_p4_95","t":"And another...\n\nEUR/USD M5","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#95","p":4,"im":["00ccf63d52a34ff22e8a8c88cdd2f2b76f19081f"],"m":95},{"id":"3drive_p4_96","t":"EUR/USD M5 - I accidentally labeled supply as demand.... typo.\n\nEUR/USD M5 (showing supply level and Hook)","a":"bennygill","d":"","n":"#96","p":4,"im":["322fc19d5c663c2ea41a65e303db0ddc42237f19","94210b6a15244dd494357c40d8b2dd1c999619c8"],"m":96},{"id":"3drive_p4_97","t":"Hi, everyone, I am just new to here and not very familiar with the edit skill yet, can anyone\n\ngive some comment as to whether it is s/d zone and 3 drive setup? thank you!:)","a":"themchose","d":"","n":"#97","p":4,"im":["50b8526f5bbccd9147eda1439fb1398b2ab72b71","4dd85dad8283b4897f9e0a248260448ce88c758e"],"m":97},{"id":"3drive_p4_98","t":"3D to S\n\nEur/Usd","a":"morob","d":"","n":"#98","p":4,"im":["15c39b6920ca8d40fbb47e5e428d7cb5abed15bf"],"m":98},{"id":"3drive_p4_99","t":"new learning for me,,,,tks","a":"kucaifx","d":"","n":"#99","p":4,"im":[],"m":99},{"id":"3drive_p4_100","t":"3D to S\n\n15M TF Eur/Usd","a":"morob","d":"","n":"#100","p":4,"im":["40f33d946d5a2ce86e19c1ced4f4ed962d6a66ce"],"m":100}],"images":[{"k":"56a929e27fa4e7409d6e0ebf6cd5c2a441b7589a","t":"assets/thumbs/56a929e27fa4e7409d6e0ebf6cd5c2a441b7589a.webp","f":"assets/images/56a929e27fa4e7409d6e0ebf6cd5c2a441b7589a.jpeg","w":1365,"h":616,"b":150723,"o":"56a929e27fa4e7409d6e0ebf6cd5c2a441b7589a.jpeg","p":4,"pid":"3drive_p4_77"},{"k":"3eed0d672a77addd86212f09f3b226f9885d169d","t":"assets/thumbs/3eed0d672a77addd86212f09f3b226f9885d169d.webp","f":"assets/images/3eed0d672a77addd86212f09f3b226f9885d169d.jpeg","w":1365,"h":637,"b":75424,"o":"3eed0d672a77addd86212f09f3b226f9885d169d.jpeg","p":4,"pid":"3drive_p4_79"},{"k":"5de522d7f927f47634ee6fbdc9bc42de9e850a89","t":"assets/thumbs/5de522d7f927f47634ee6fbdc9bc42de9e850a89.webp","f":"assets/images/5de522d7f927f47634ee6fbdc9bc42de9e85